  "notes": [
    "Do not scale the drawing; follow written dimensions. Room sizes are clear inside sizes (wall face to wall face).",
    "Structure: load-bearing masonry, brick in cement mortar 1:6. External walls 11\" (280 mm) to carry the first floor; internal walls 9\" (230 mm). Outer face of the building is unchanged; the extra 2\" is taken inside.",
    "Padavi is open (no walls). Its RCC slab is carried by 6 RCC pillars 9\" x 9\": 4 along the front (6'-4\" clear bays) and 2 at the back corners against the house front wall, with RCC beams along the front and both sides. Pillar, beam and footing sizes to be confirmed by the structural engineer.",
    "Provide RCC plinth band and RCC lintel band (6\" deep) over all walls; door/window tops at lintel level 7'-0\".",
    "Assumed levels, confirm with engineer: plinth +1'-6\" above road, floor-to-floor 10'-0\", lintel +7'-0\" above floor.",
    "Bathroom and toilet: sunken slab 1'-0\", waterproofing 1'-0\" up the walls (3'-0\" in shower), floor 1/2\" below kitchen, sloped to FT.",
    "Staircase in Padavi: dog-legged, 3'-0\" wide flights, 17 risers of about 7\", treads 10\", landing 3'-0\" x 6'-0\"; MS handrail 3'-0\" high and railing on the open north side.",
    "Kitchen: L-shaped platform 2'-0\" deep at 2'-8\" height, along the hall-side wall from O2 and up the left wall past W2, sink under W2; provide chimney/exhaust opening on the left wall.",
    "Toilet has two WCs: Indian pan (IWC) on the rear wall and wall-hung western WC (EWC) with concealed cistern on the right wall, giving about 1'-8\" clear in front. Provide health faucets for both.",
    "Passage in front of bathroom/toilet is 2'-10½\" clear. Electrical, plumbing and structural drawings to be issued separately.",
    "Bedroom: queen bed 5'-0\" x 6'-6\" with headboard on the front wall, centred (1'-9½\" each side for side tables); wardrobe 4'-0\" x 1'-6\" deep, full height 7'-0\", in the rear-right corner clear of the D2 swing.",
    "Windows are centred on their rooms. Doors D1, D2 and opening O2 sit flush against the central Hall/Bedroom partition.",
    "Windows W1/W2 face 1'-0\" to 3'-0\" side gaps; confirm neighbour clearance before fixing.",
    "Store room behind the kitchen is deferred to a future phase; the kitchen rear wall is built as an external wall for now."
  ],

